      "jcr:created": "Wed Sep 03 2025 18:13:26 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Thank you for your interest in <b>Stryker Interventional Spine (IVS) Reimbursement Support</b>. Please review our site for the latest <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/interventional-spine/reimbursement/reimbursement-guides.html\" target=\"_blank\">reimbursement guides</a>.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">If you can't find what you're looking for, fill out the form below and we'll get back to you within the next 24 hours.* We look forward to our continued partnership. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reimbursement hotline: 1 954 302 4591<br>\n <a href=\"mailto:%20ivs-reimbursement@stryker.com\">ivs-reimbursement@stryker.com</a></span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 15 2025 13:42:46 GMT+0000",
